fsirEnglish": "Tafsir (Surah 66, Verse 11): Exegesis and reflection upon this sacred verse.", "tafsirBangla": "তাফসীর (সূরা 66, আয়াত 11): এই বরকতময় আয়াতের শানে নুযূল ও গভীর তাৎপর্য।", "audioUrl": "https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/066011.mp3", "juz": 28, "sajdah": false, "words": [{"arabic": "وَضَرَبَ", "transliteration": "", "english": "وَضَرَبَ", "bangla": "وَضَرَبَ"}, {"arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "transliteration": "", "english": "ٱللَّهُ", "bangla": "ٱللَّهُ"}, {"arabic": "مَثَلًۭا", "transliteration": "", "english": "مَثَلًۭا", "bangla": "مَثَلًۭا"}, {"arabic": "لِّلَّذِينَ", "transliteration": "", "english": "لِّلَّذِينَ", "bangla": "لِّلَّذِينَ"}, {"arabic": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "transliteration": "", "english": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "bangla": "ءَامَنُوا۟"}, {"arabic": "ٱمْرَأَتَ", "transliteration": "", "english": "ٱمْرَأَتَ", "bangla": "ٱمْرَأَتَ"}, {"arabic": "فِرْعَوْنَ", "transliteration": "", "english": "فِرْعَوْنَ", "bangla": "فِرْعَوْنَ"}, {"arabic": "إِذْ", "transliteration": "", "english": "إِذْ", "bangla": "إِذْ"}, {"arabic": "قَالَتْ", "transliteration": "", "english": "قَالَتْ", "bangla": "قَالَتْ"}, {"arabic": "رَبِّ", "transliteration": "", "english": "رَبِّ", "bangla": "رَبِّ"}, {"arabic": "ٱبْنِ", "transliteration": "", "english": "ٱبْنِ", "bangla": "ٱبْنِ"}, {"arabic": "لِى", "transliteration": "", "english": "لِى", "bangla": "لِى"}, {"arabic": "عِندَكَ", "transliteration": "", "english": "عِندَكَ", "bangla": "عِندَكَ"}, {"arabic": "بَيْتًۭا", "transliteration": "", "english": "بَيْتًۭا", "bangla": "بَيْتًۭا"}, {"arabic": "فِى", "transliteration": "", "english": "فِى", "bangla": "فِى"}, {"arabic": "ٱلْجَنَّةِ", "transliteration": "", "english": "ٱلْجَنَّةِ", "bangla": "ٱلْجَنَّةِ"}, {"arabic": "وَنَجِّنِى", "transliteration": "", "english": "وَنَجِّنِى", "bangla": "وَنَجِّنِى"}, {"arabic": "مِن", "transliteration": "", "english": "مِن", "bangla": "مِن"}, {"arabic": "فِرْعَوْنَ", "transliteration": "", "english": "فِرْعَوْنَ", "bangla": "فِرْعَوْنَ"}, {"arabic": "وَعَمَلِهِۦ", "transliteration": "", "english": "وَعَمَلِهِۦ", "bangla": "وَعَمَلِهِۦ"}, {"arabic": "وَنَجِّنِى", "transliteration": "", "english": "وَنَجِّنِى", "bangla": "وَنَجِّنِى"}, {"arabic": "مِنَ", "transliteration": "", "english": "مِنَ", "bangla": "مِنَ"}, {"arabic": "ٱلْقَوْمِ", "transliteration": "", "english": "ٱلْقَوْمِ", "bangla": "ٱلْقَوْمِ"}, {"arabic": "ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ", "transliteration": "", "english": "ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ", "bangla": "ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"}]}, {"number": 12, "globalNumber": 5241, "textArabic": "وَمَرْيَمَ ٱبْنَتَ عِمْرَٰنَ ٱلَّتِىٓ أَحْصَنَتْ فَرْجَهَا فَنَفَخْنَا فِيهِ مِن رُّوحِنَا وَصَدَّقَتْ بِكَلِمَٰتِ رَبِّهَا وَكُتُبِهِۦ وَكَانَتْ مِنَ ٱلْقَٰنِتِينَ", "translationEnglish": "And [the example of] Mary, the daughter of 'Imran, who guarded her chastity, so We blew into [her garment] through Our angel, and she believed in the words of her Lord and His scriptures and was of the devoutly obedient.", "translationBangla": "আর দৃষ্টান্ত বর্ণনা করেছেন এমরান-তনয়া মরিয়মের, যে তার সতীত্ব বজায় রেখেছিল। অতঃপর আমি তার মধ্যে আমার পক্ষ থেকে জীবন ফুঁকে দিয়েছিলাম এবং সে তার পালনকর্তার বানী ও কিতাবকে সত্যে পরিণত করেছিল। সে ছিল বিনয় প্রকাশকারীনীদের একজন।", "transliterationBangla": "", "tafsirEnglish": "Tafsir (Surah 66, Verse 12): Exegesis and reflection upon this sacred verse.", "tafsirBangla": "তাফসীর (সূরা 66, আয়াত 12): এই বরকতময় আয়াতের শানে নুযূল ও গভীর তাৎপর্য।", "audioUrl": "https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/066012.mp3", "juz": 28, "sajdah": false, "words": [{"arabic": "وَمَرْيَمَ", "transliteration": "", "english": "وَمَرْيَمَ", "bangla": "وَمَرْيَمَ"}, {"arabic": "ٱبْنَتَ", "transliteration": "", "english": "ٱبْنَتَ", "bangla": "ٱبْنَتَ"}, {"arabic": "عِمْرَٰنَ", "transliteration": "", "english": "عِمْرَٰنَ", "bangla": "عِمْرَٰنَ"}, {"arabic": "ٱلَّتِىٓ", "transliteration": "", "english": "ٱلَّتِىٓ", "bangla": "ٱلَّتِىٓ"}, {"arabic": "أَحْصَنَتْ", "transliteration": "", "english": "أَحْصَنَتْ", "bangla": "أَحْصَنَتْ"}, {"arabic